# ユーザ環境設定〈ＰＤ属性〉の指の行 (design 6.4.1, 10.4.6, 11.6), for tools/ui_run.py.
# The window's work area is at 190,118. The tag ＰＤ属性 at 307,135; タッチ操作補正 at
# 414,477; the volumes 位置許容度（タッチ） at 506,507, つまみ範囲（タッチ） at 506,535,
# 長押し時間（タッチ） at 430,563 (towards 短). The switch off: the two lengths grey, a
# press on them changes nothing; on again: they are worked; the hold is worked either way.
# What the parts set is said on the console ("userenv: touch NUM = VALUE").
open 01a0d8c4-52b7-7c63-8e83-4f9a012c3d53
expect userenv: ready
wait 800
click 307 135
wait 500
shot ue_pd
click 414 477
expect userenv: touch 9144 = 0
wait 300
shot ue_touch_off
click 506 507
click 506 535
wait 500
absent userenv: touch 9145
absent userenv: touch 9146
click 430 563
expect userenv: touch 9147 =
click 414 477
expect userenv: touch 9144 = 1
click 506 507
expect userenv: touch 9145 =
click 506 535
expect userenv: touch 9146 =
wait 300
shot ue_touch_on
